  "notes": "{頼|たよ}る means to rely on, depend on, or turn to someone/something for help or support.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Takes ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ particle: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{頼|たよ}る (to rely on X)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{親|おや}→親：01357_oya⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{頼|たよ}る: to rely on one's parents\n- ⟦{辞書|じしょ}→辞書：04707_jisho⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{頼|たよ}る: to depend on a dictionary\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{頼|たよ}らない: not relying on others\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{頼|たよ}り→頼り：14634_tayori⟧: reliance, dependence; news, word from someone\n- ⟦{頼|たよ}りになる→頼りになる：20294_tayorininaru⟧: to be reliable/dependable\n- ⟦{頼|たの}む→頼む：01104_tanomu⟧: to request, ask (different reading, transitive)\n\nUSAGE:\nOften implies needing help or support, can have a slightly dependent connotation.\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {頼|たよ}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: relies on / depends on (ongoing state)\n- Note: {頼|たよ}る describes a standing dependency rather than a momentary action, so the て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ form expresses the current state of reliance. ⟦{親|おや}→親：01357_oya⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{頼|たよ}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ means \"depends on his parents\" (as an ongoing situation), not \"is in the process of relying.\"",
